o Payment methods
-----------------
- "How am I charged?"
     Currently, due to our size, our only billing method is through Visa and
     Mastercard. If you have another credit card that you think we should take,
     let us know, and given sufficient interest, we'll look into providing it. 

- "I don't use credit cards."
     If you don't like using credit cards, we don't blame you, neither do we. 
     We are actively searching for sensible electronic alternatives, and would 
     appreciate any suggestions you may have. Some banks have recently begun 
     issueing cards that can be accepted like a credit card, yet immediately 
     debit the users checking account, and some will even pay the user a bonus
     for using it. 

- "What about charging to a checking account?"
     While we've discovered a method of charging to the consumers checking 
     account, it would cost an additional $2 a month. If you find that the 
     convenience afforded by charging directly to your checking account is 
     worth this price, let us know. If enough users are interested, we will 
     make it available. Also, see the above paragraph regarding credit/debit
     card alternatives.
